</script></div></div><section class="section-overview-cs"><div class="container-cs"><div class="row-split-cs"><div class="overline-pd">Overview</div><div class="col-main-cs"><div class="stats-cs"><div class="stat-cs"><div class="stat-num-cs">+23%</div><div class="stat-label-cs">Website conversions</div></div><div class="stat-cs"><div class="stat-num-cs">80+</div><div class="stat-label-cs">Countries in the panel</div></div><div class="stat-cs"><div class="stat-num-cs">32</div><div class="stat-label-cs">Languages</div></div></div><h2 class="h3-cs">Key highlights</h2><div class="highlights-cs"><div class="highlight-cs"><img src="/assets/6909ed375ee6ef22dffa47c2__6ab80bdc600b3481320ffd5b_pd-icon-check-dark.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="icon-check-cs"/><div class="text-16-cs">Created a new brand identity: playful, but confident.</div></div><div class="highlight-cs"><img src="/assets/6909ed375ee6ef22dffa47c2__6ab80bdc600b3481320ffd5b_pd-icon-check-dark.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="icon-check-cs"/><div class="text-16-cs">Redesigned the marketing website and built it in Framer.</div></div><div class="highlight-cs"><img src="/assets/6909ed375ee6ef22dffa47c2__6ab80bdc600b3481320ffd5b_pd-icon-check-dark.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="icon-check-cs"/><div class="text-16-cs">Designed the whole app portfolio: Multipolls, RewardsRoo and Golden Surveys.</div></div><div class="highlight-cs"><img src="/assets/6909ed375ee6ef22dffa47c2__6ab80bdc600b3481320ffd5b_pd-icon-check-dark.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="icon-check-cs"/><div class="text-16-cs">Rewrote the homepage around one line and one button, "Request demo".</div></div><div class="highlight-cs"><img src="/assets/6909ed375ee6ef22dffa47c2__6ab80bdc600b3481320ffd5b_pd-icon-check-dark.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="icon-check-cs"/><div class="text-16-cs">Moved the proof, users, countries and languages, to the top of the page.</div></div><div class="highlight-cs"><img src="/assets/6909ed375ee6ef22dffa47c2__6ab80bd